00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,658
So F equals minus m g sine theta.

2
00:00:03,658 --> 00:00:09,166
That is not quite simple harmonic, because sine theta is not the same as theta.

3
00:00:09,166 --> 00:00:15,325
But for small angles, measured in radians, sine theta is very nearly theta.

4
00:00:15,325 --> 00:00:19,101
And the arc length x equals L theta.

